  <title>Partially Ordered Sets</title>

  <worksheet xml:id="ws-posets-antichain-partitioning">
    <title>Antichain Partitioning</title>
    
    
    <activity>
      <task>
        <statement>
          <p>
            Use the algorithm to find the height <m>h</m>, a maximum chain, and a partition into <m>h</m> antichains for each of the posets below.
          </p>
        </statement>
      </task>
      <task>
        <statement>
          <p>
            What can you say about the width of these posets? In particular, is one of the antichains in your antichain partition maximum?
          </p>
        </statement>
      </task> 
    </activity>
